---
import { outcomes } from '../../data/portfolio.js';
---
<section class="slide page outcomes-page" id="outcomes" aria-labelledby="outcomes-title">
  <div class="page-inner outcomes-layout">
    <div class="outcomes-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> PRODUCT OUTCOMES</div><h2 id="outcomes-title">Outcomes that connect product work<br/>to <em>real business performance.</em></h2><p>Measurable impact across adoption, efficiency, automation, compliance and cost optimization from my product work in fintech, healthcare and telecom.</p></div><aside class="outcome-lens"><b>◎</b><div><strong>Outcome lens</strong><small>Each outcome maps to a business goal and is measured through clear metrics across adoption, efficiency, automation, cost and impact.</small></div></aside><div class="outcome-chart"><div class="chart-caption">From product execution<br/>to <b>measurable business<br/>value</b> →</div><svg viewBox="0 0 340 190" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 160 Q140 150 310 20"/><path d="M300 18l11 2-2 12"/></svg><div class="bars-graphic">{[20,30,43,59,75,91].map((h,i)=><i style={`height:${h}%`}></i>)}</div></div></div>
    <div class="outcome-metrics">{outcomes.map((item, i) => <article class:list={['outcome-metric', `tone-${item.color}`]}><div class="outcome-metric-head"><span>{['♟','◷','▧','⚙','ϟ','▤'][i]}</span><div><strong>{item.value}</strong><h3>{item.title}</h3><small>{item.source}</small></div></div><div class="sparkline">{[30,45,38,56,52,68,62,83,74,100].map((h) => <i style={`height:${h}%`}></i>)}</div><div class="metric-delta"><b>{item.delta}</b><span>{item.detail}</span></div></article>)}</div>
    <div class="outcome-bottom"><article class="outcome-framework"><h3>▥ &nbsp; Outcome Framework</h3><p>I link product work to measurable outcomes across the full product lifecycle.</p><div class="outcome-steps">{['Adoption','Engagement','Efficiency','Compliance','Business Impact'].map((x,i)=><span>{['♟','▥','⚙','⬡','▥'][i]}<b>{x}</b></span>)}</div></article><article class="domain-outcomes"><h3>▥ &nbsp; Key Outcomes by Domain</h3><p>Representative impact from selected product initiatives.</p>{[['Adoption & Engagement','+60%','green'],['Operational Efficiency','+35%','blue'],['Compliance & Risk Reduction','+25%','amber'],['Cost Optimization','+25%','purple']].map(([name,value,color])=><div class="domain-bar"><b>{name}</b><span><i class={`fill-${color}`}></i></span><strong>{value}</strong></div>)}</article><article class="business-impact"><h3>🏆 &nbsp; Business Impact</h3><p>Delivering value for customers, internal teams and end users.</p><div class="impact-grid">{[['↗','Better Customer Experience','Higher adoption and usage'],['₹','Lower Operational Cost','Automation and efficiency'],['⬡','Stronger Compliance Posture','Reduced risk and audit effort'],['▥','Scalable Product Platforms','Multi-tenant, configurable and integration-ready']].map(([icon,title,detail])=><div><b>{icon}</b><span><strong>{title}</strong><small>{detail}</small></span></div>)}</div></article></div>
    <div class="outcome-categories"><b>▦ &nbsp; Outcome categories<br/><small>Key areas I measure across all products.</small></b><span>♟ <strong>Adoption</strong><small>Users, activation, engagement</small></span><span>⚙ <strong>Efficiency</strong><small>Time, effort, productivity</small></span><span>⬡ <strong>Compliance</strong><small>Risk, audit, regulatory</small></span><span>▤ <strong>Cost</strong><small>Opex, manual effort</small></span><span>▥ <strong>Business Impact</strong><small>Revenue, growth, customer value</small></span></div>
  </div>
</section>
